<Slide style={{ padding: '20px 60px', background: '#F7F4EC' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>第 6 章 · 报告清单：你要找的东西都在这</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.62)', marginTop: 6 }}>点左侧「报告」。这里按时间倒序列出所有运行，一行两个按钮，分工明确</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, padding: '9px 16px', background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.12)', border: '1px solid rgba(184,115,15,0.45)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B8730F' }}>本机 29 次运行</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 412, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Image src="assets/10_reportlist.png" style={{ width: 872, height: 412, borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 112, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 14, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>① 查看 = 全部产物</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.72)', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>列出这个运行目录下的每一件东西：报告、审计、HTML、中间件，都能点开。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 14, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>② 阅读报告 = 直接看结论</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.72)', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>跳过文件树，直接打开 Markdown 正文 —— 只想看结论时用这个。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 14, background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(184,115,15,0.40)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8A5608' }}>③ 徽标看完整度</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>带「审计」「HTML 报告」标签的运行说明产物更完整，优先看这些。</Text>
